        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:4-8 Taz Isa 14:29-31; 23:1-18; Yer 47:1-7; Eze 25:15–28:26; Amo 1:6-10; Sef 2:4-7; Zek 9:1-7; Mat 11:21-22; Luka 10:13-14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Mnataka kunifanya nini enyi Tiro na Sidoni na maeneo yote ya Filistia? Je, mna kisasi nami mnachotaka kulipiza? Kama mnalipiza kisasi, mimi nitawalipizeni mara moja! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmechukua fedha na dhahabu yangu, na kuvibeba vitu vyangu vya thamani hadi kwenye mahekalu yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmewapeleka watu wa Yuda na Yerusalemu mbali na nchi yao, mkawauza kwa Wagiriki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa, nitawarudisha watu wangu kutoka huko mlikowauza. Nitawalipizeni kisasi kwa yote mliyowatendea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watoto wenu wa kiume na wa kike nitawafanya wauzwe kwa watu wa Yuda, nao watawauzia Washeba, watu wa taifa la mbali kabisa. Mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu nimesema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
